{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-08_beg","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-08","title":"黄昏","storyCode":"3-8","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"7f6f6489c5bbb12edc400e9af6b57b4a813095838b64a16d1db71b9f6a3c372c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"双方的思绪如同平行线，虽然笔直，却没有交点。\n即使阿米娅认出了“碎骨”，一切也已经没有了挽回的余地。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"咕！他们还在反击！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"碎骨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"只要现在击退他们，我们就能胜利了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"现在......只能战斗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"这些人......有点难缠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！那面盾，可恶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，她，她是龙门近卫局的......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你们现在放下武器投降，你们还有机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"除非想白白送命的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"我们怎么可能会相信你的话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"别骗人了！乌萨斯......不是没有劝降过感染者。一个接一个的，最后都被处决了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"而我趴在死尸堆里，苟延残喘，最后活了下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这些家伙为了消灭我们......做出来的事情有多卑鄙都不稀奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"不就是要把我们感染者，赶尽杀绝吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"那就战斗到最后一刻吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"个子很大的小姐，无论你现在说什么，他们可都是听不进去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟他们可没法分辨龙门的好人和乌萨斯的恶人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"在那个地方——不，在很多地方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"普通人和感染者之间，就是只有互相憎恨而已，没别的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"看来......已经无法交流了。明明出路就摆在眼前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"出路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们，能做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"你，又能做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"不要和她废话了！碎骨！我们一起干掉他们！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"爆炸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"他打算从各个地方包围我们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"再这样被动下去侧翼会顶不住的......组织反击！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"碎骨！我掩护你！拿下他们战斗就结束了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"碎骨——————！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须......和你们一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须————！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"————————————"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没多少时间了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我准备好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"谨慎行动，别在敌人面前暴露弱点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"不会给他们机会的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"小心敌人的冲锋！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！别接近敌人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那，那是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，博士......我该怎么办......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你该做的事，阿米娅。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，博士......我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"阿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"会变成这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"碎骨","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......大概这就是命运吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！你在做什么？快......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"啧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陈长官？我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"还是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这一切该结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......陈长官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要告诉你一件事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"从现在开始，你最好对所有感染者一视同仁。那些都是你的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"命运是不公的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"要恨，就恨我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局！进攻！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近卫局队员"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["芙兰卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊","陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","aliases":["碎骨"]}]}
